WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>15 Minutes Before the Last Episode . . . ! !</b>

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.960
The final qualifier for the Hexennacht.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.070
The Japanese school versus the Coalition school.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:21.330
Whoever wins gets a ticket 
to the main tournament.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.390
Who are you betting on?

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.900
Here we go!

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:04.010
<b>Episode 6:
Cinderella Doesn't Look Back</b>

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:11.690
Sadohara-san, get back!

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:14.900
Robe of the Fire Rat!

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.410
Nobody said anything 
about them having cannons!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.650
That fortress...

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.440
It seems they got one up on us.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:32.170
Fire!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.880
Kasumi-san, go ahead.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.490
Right.

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:44.930
Here I go!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.640
Magic Mallet!

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.480
<i>And that's Shizuka's...</i>

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.440
Jeweled Branch of Horai!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.670
<i>We'll just push forward...</i>

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.070
Feather Cloth!

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:25.300
Kasumi-san, how much longer 
can you use the Magic Mallet?

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.320
Two big ones.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.150
Three, if I push myself.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.390
Leave it to me.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.390
I'll...

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.770
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:38.650
Your magic wears down your Buchhülle.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.030
If you use it too much, 
you'll be unable to continue.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.080
I'm sorry...

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.880
I'm slowing us down, aren't I?

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:50.050
Th-That's not what I meant...

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.540
Sadohara-san!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:58.910
Are you all right?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.480
What's going on?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.630
Sadohara-san?

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:06.630
Kasumi-san?

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.670
I won't let you go any further.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.210
Confused, aren't you?

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.270
Shocked, aren't you?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:22.720
"Shizuka Tsuchimikado ordered me 
to search the right room!"

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.760
"Circumstances may justify a lie."

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:30.110
It's a sneaky kind of magic 
that makes your opponent believe a lie.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:33.990
The lie has to be a tiny one, too.

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.430
<i>She confused us and split us up...</i>

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:40.010
<i>I can't use the Magic Mallet here.</i>

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.010
Then...

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:44.720
I can't win in a straight-up fight.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:49.140
So I'll lie to myself.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:50.630
Thousand Needles!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.270
A wonderful strike, without hesitation!

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.380
But that makes it easy to read.

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.170
Lie to yourself...

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.240
That's what you meant?

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.640
My name is Charles Giovanni!

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:08.380
My Origin is Puss in Boots!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.950
I am the strongest 
and fastest swordswoman!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.290
Now, let us fight!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.130
I got tired of waiting, Shizuka.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:23.840
Sadohara-san!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:41.850
Damn you...

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.030
Full bombardment!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.770
Origin: The Pied Piper of Hamelin.

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:54.200
Is that all you've got?

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.590
Don't even try, Molly.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.140
You can't beat Shizuka with a gun.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.490
Fine.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.750
Impressive.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:07.130
But the Moon Princess is far 
more powerful than that, right?

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.030
Wait!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.560
Sadohara-san!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.430
Don't worry!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.030
The Buchhülle is taking the damage.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:23.880
But that means one 
of you has left the game.

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:25.870
I'm... sorry...

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.240
How dare you...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.020
It's not my fault.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:40.230
The Moon Princess abandons the ones she loves

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.040
and returns alone to the moon.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:45.630
That's the story of the Origin 
you made a contract with.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:48.800
Partings and loneliness.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:53.200
That is the destiny the Origin 
Master of the Moon Princess must bear.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.100
You're the one who is responsible for this.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.800
You know that, right?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:05.400
Your friends just keep leaving you, huh?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.550
Is that the Origin's curse...

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.100
...up.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.490
Look!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.480
You're all alone!

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:16.280
Mai Sadohara, Ariko Kasumi,

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:17.620
and Kagimura...

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.000
Shut up!

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.050
Molly!

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:33.810
<i>This is...</i>

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:34.940
Shizuka!

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:45.920
Are you okay?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.000
I guess.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.070
Okay. Get back.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:08:00.000
<i>There we go. That's Princess 
Kaguya's ultimate magic.</i>

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.650
<i>The moon ship.</i>

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.630
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.780
Dragon's Jaw Bombardment!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.780
I've been waiting for this!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:37.710
I've been waiting for this, Shizuka.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.520
The moment you used your ultimate magic.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.540
My dragon...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.730
A magic that steals magic.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:50.880
That is the ultimate magic 
of my Origin, Shuten-Doji.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.090
The Master Thief!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.680
Yumelia Qazan...

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.800
She was hiding that?

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:03.270
Well... Normally, it wouldn't work 
on somebody like Shizuka Tsuchimikado.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.190
The Moon Princess's loneliness...

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.660
That was a cruel thing Qazan-chan said.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:22.120
Sorry, but I'm taking the rest, too.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.370
Your heart....

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.380
...is defenseless!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:41.810
Shizuka!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:47.940
Sorry.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.150
Shizuka...

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:03.010
So this is the power 
of the oldest surviving Origin...

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.240
the Moon Princess...

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.200
Give it back...

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:13.850
My...

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.380
It's over.

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:30.270
I thought I was a goner.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.430
I need to go find Shizuka-chan!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:40.090
Hazuki-san...

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.070
Why?

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.280
Shizuka-san...

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.100
Wh-What happened?

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:45.320
You're a mess!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.250
I-Is this... really bad?

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.040
She ruined the holy festival!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.960
Who is that girl?

00:10:57.220 --> 00:11:00.720
Hazuki Kagimura, 
the Maedchen of Cinderella...

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.680
Or she was, rather.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.660
Why the hell did you come back?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.420
I-I'm a member of the Japanese school, too!

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.280
I think...

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.620
You're not cut out to be a Maedchen!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.890
After all I said, you still don't understand?

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:19.750
Listen.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.010
A Maedchen gets taken over by their Origin.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:28.010
You feed the Origin 
the greed and misery it wants,

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.620
and in exchange, you get its magic.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:33.910
That's why I, the Shuten-Doji Origin Master,

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.320
steal everything I desire!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.090
She's the same.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.880
Stop it...

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.400
She's fated to be alone.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.940
Please...

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.060
Stop...

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.850
This isn't a game.

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:50.750
Leave!

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:55.630
That... That doesn't make sense...

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.560
Qazan-san, you're Qazan-san.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:01.390
And Shizuka-chan is Shizuka-chan, right?

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.030
Why do you have to do what the book says?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.010
You're not getting it!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.500
I don't understand you!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.620
That's how it's always been!

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:16.120
That's the contract between 
an Origin and an Origin Master...

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:18.840
A book only says what it says!

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:31.180
I'm not cute like Cinderella, 
and I don't care about a prince.

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:36.270
And my mom and my sister aren't mean, at all!

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.780
The story of Cinderella 
doesn't make sense, anyway!

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:45.170
<i>Why did the prince fall 
in love with Cinderella?</i>

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.990
<i>Was the prince really 
the right person for her?</i>

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:54.340
<i>And what kind of useless magic 
spells end at midnight, anyway?</i>

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:59.690
So if I were to make 
the story of Cinderella...

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.710
"Cinderella said,"

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:06.080
"'Thank you for a wonderful evening, Prince,"

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.510
"but I'm going home."

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.730
"My kind sister and mother,"

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.640
"and my wonderful friends are waiting for me.'"

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.370
"Cinderella started running."

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.780
"The prince called for her to return,"

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:23.050
"but Cinderella didn't look back."

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:28.260
It's done!

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:30.860
This is my story.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.120
My Cinderella!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.370
Hazuki-san...

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.650
If you really want to decide for yourself,
 I'll let you choose.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:42.080
Move now, and I'll slice Shizuka apart.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.170
If you don't, I'll slice you apart.

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:46.200
No, I won't move.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.330
Then I'll start with you...

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:49.600
I-I don't want that, either!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.060
Enough already!

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.730
But it was sealed away...

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.030
You saved me?

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.590
But I found my own story.

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:10.040
So I can't be Cinderella!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.720
<i>If you're okay with that, 
then make another contract with me!</i>

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.990
Oh, no...

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.910
The story is disappearing!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:33.010
No, it's being born.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.850
<i>This is my...</i>

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:39.830
I see.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.300
Thank you.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:45.300
Then let's make a new story together.

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.700
Where nobody gets hurt.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.210
Nobody is sad.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:50.240
A wonderful happy ending!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.810
A new story needs a new title.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.040
My story... A story that belongs to only me.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.960
Its title is...

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:02.420
"Cinderella Doesn't Look Back!"

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.350
This is my Buchhülle!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:14.790
She did it!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:16.060
That's it?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.890
Who are you?

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:22.920
I don't understand you!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.770
Take this! Lightning Slash!

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.210
The Castle!

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:42.880
Damn it! Out of the way!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:54.320
This is your magic?

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.930
Don't insult me!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.920
Magic is more...

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.280
Damn it!

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.520
You...

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.120
That's...

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:08.380
Qazan-san, return my magic to me now!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.080
It will destroy you otherwise!

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:17.300
<i>Qazan-chan's heart is at its limits.</i>

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:20.210
<i>She did a good job, for a sacrificial pawn.</i>

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.150
This power is mine...

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.430
I gained it!

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.570
This is my magic...

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:33.540
I'm the only one who can stop it.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.390
It's too dangerous, Shizuka-chan!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.310
You can't do it in that condition.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.840
Qazan, stop it!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.880
Want to go with me?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.220
Boss...

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.420
<i>This power is mine.</i>

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.550
<i>A place to call home...</i>

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.660
<i>A place that can protect them...</i>

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.420
<i>Qazan-san's in trouble!</i>

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.890
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.500
<i>Tell me, Cinderella!</i>

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:21.480
<i>I know!</i>

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:23.900
<i>I'll just make a new magic!</i>

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:27.520
<i>The story has that power!</i>

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.170
Hazuki-san!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.620
Sorry I didn't ask for more, guys...

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.710
We don't have a place to call home.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.060
It's okay.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.740
We're all together.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.000
That's enough.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:42.860
That's right... 
Yeah, that's right.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:46.830
<i>It didn't matter where we called home,</i>

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.950
<i>as long as the three of us were together...</i>

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.720
<i>I'm a fool.</i>

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.010
What's happening?

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.300
I don't know.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:02.730
But it's probably the birth of a new magic,

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:05.370
one we old Origin Wielders don't know.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:18.800
Are you okay, Boss?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.970
She doesn't look hurt.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.720
Yay!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:25.870
What kind of magic is that?

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:33.320
You really are amazing.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.000
So...

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.660
We lose.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.310
Wh-What happened?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.490
We won!

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:51.800
Our magic is now spreading 
out into Origin Libraries

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.680
all around the world.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.850
It's all thanks to you.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:01.100
No, not at all!

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:04.720
I was so mean to you...

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.890
I'm sorry.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:08.760
<i>I have to say something... say something...</i>

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.300
I-I liked you from the moment we met.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.180
Please be my friend!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.440
If you don't want to be my friend, 
that's fine!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.270
Really, don't worry about it.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.110
We're already...

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:26.260
We're already friends, Hazuki-san.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:39.830
<i>Mom told me to find my own story.</i>

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.010
Hey, Mom,

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.210
<i>did you feel that?</i>

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:45.960
Yeah.

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.180
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.940
<i>What was that?</i>

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.010
I couldn't say.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:54.730
But I'm sure something good happened to her.

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:58.690
<i>That's why you called, right?</i>

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.760
It's like magic, isn't it?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.700
Well, it's Christmas.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:06.280
W-We won!

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.120
It has begun...

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:15.040
Hazuki Kagimura, huh?

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:32.900
<i>And that's how I found my own story.</i>

00:23:06.130 --> 00:23:07.140
It's me, Hazuki!

00:23:07.140 --> 00:23:08.570
Today, I'm going to introduce people

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:10.280
who don't get a lot of time in the main show!

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:12.190
It's Charles and Molly from the Coalition!

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:14.090
What do you mean we don't 
get any screen time?

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:15.120
I'm super-ticked.

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:17.250
I-It was in the script!

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:18.310
I'm fighting back!

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:20.520
I'm posting all kinds 
of things on social media.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:21.730
Viral marketing...

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:23.420
Qazan-san will get mad!

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:24.590
That's not good!

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:26.360
She's really amazing when she gets mad.

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:28.780
Next time: The Allegory of the Honest Man.

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:35.060
